  "content": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/zjsTXd5.png\" width=\"640\" height=\"400\"></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>《優質裝備》模組在遊戲中引入了重鑄台，可以為你的所有裝備賦予品質，每種品質都能強化不同的屬性。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/VUSrKCz.gif\" width=\"570\" height=\"352\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>要重鑄你的工具，你需要一個重鑄台，在重鑄台中將裝備與其修復材料結合。如果裝備沒有對應的修復材料，則會使用設定檔中設定的預設材料。修復材料可以被覆蓋，沒有修復材料的裝備也可以在設定檔中定義材料。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/667174/description_9c6877f0-e201-4c23-9d55-215772e68952.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"771\" height=\"432\"></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>(1.20.1) 品質可以在模組設定檔中自定義</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>(1.21.1+) 品質完全由數據驅動。你可以透過數據包添加或調整任何品質。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>本模組嘗試在不使用任何原始代碼的情況下，盡可能貼近地重現《優質工具》中的所有內容。</strong></span></p><hr><h2>工具品質</h2><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimgur.com%252fWEeEdAd.png\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/WEeEdAd.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"215\" height=\"131\"></a></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/JVStw6b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"219\" height=\"72\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/HTxy3md.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"205\" height=\"87\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/tssA9SZ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"207\" height=\"88\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/cQ2TQGS.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"218\" height=\"89\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/t1khbFF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"193\" height=\"87\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/A6JstSg.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"205\" height=\"67\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/MFNdI2k.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"216\" height=\"107\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/m1LHIup.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"203\" height=\"87\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/ksphzZE.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"205\" height=\"88\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/vld8dve.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"217\" height=\"88\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/sJfZKd0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"219\" height=\"66\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/2RGaIXM.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"215\" height=\"87\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/ndL0bhi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"216\" height=\"66\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/pPn5Oec.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"206\" height=\"87\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/CkCWs37.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"220\" height=\"87\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/6iIyIxe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"222\" height=\"126\"></p><hr><h2>弓/弩品質</h2><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/du1Qydb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"257\" height=\"87\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/3OPxlM0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"243\" height=\"86\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/GlmnbmW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"246\" height=\"87\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/eeNxGmw.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"257\" height=\"88\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1wc8mRy.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"257\" height=\"90\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><hr><h2>護甲品質</h2><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/xEZi4aS.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"225\" height=\"87\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/6J6ilcJ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"158\" height=\"66\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/44dag8D.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"210\" height=\"88\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/cn7ebxY.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"151\" height=\"67\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/9z3Ro04.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"149\" height=\"86\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/j1CGSNb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"178\" height=\"67\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/McNW83t.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"161\" height=\"68\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/nOFhYmo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"183\" height=\"67\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/num2PeZ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"227\" height=\"69\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/GGIyKVu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"284\" height=\"70\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/7EPPyMG.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"192\" height=\"68\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/iBFtI1E.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"149\" height=\"67\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/hftKp9m.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"285\" height=\"108\"></p><hr><h2>盾牌品質</h2><table style=\"width:82.0391%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:27.9731%\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/vEyJWI7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"182\" height=\"70\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:27.9731%\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/0UxsqC0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"182\" height=\"84\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:44.0232%\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/cAttw0Y.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"288\" height=\"70\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><h2>飾品品質 (1.21.1+)</h2><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/ZydJD2E.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"250\" height=\"107\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/9idPtF3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"243\" height=\"89\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/WK5mhfX.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"246\" height=\"65\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/oYmxHxZ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"246\" height=\"73\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/90yYK0x.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"247\" height=\"72\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/WBcVGTq.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"247\" height=\"68\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/JoA0YgB.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"248\" height=\"71\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/IPagRXH.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"249\" height=\"69\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Bokokzd.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"250\" height=\"70\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/e2FACH2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"244\" height=\"67\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/AG0s0CQ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"246\" height=\"67\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/vJV03kb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"247\" height=\"67\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/60QzByf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"245\" height=\"88\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/nSk3k0E.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"244\" height=\"88\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/bBdZzx9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"246\" height=\"89\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/4Zfz0R3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"249\" height=\"89\"></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p>&nbsp;</p><p>所有與Curios相容的飾品都支援品質。你需要在設定檔中為它們設定材料，否則它們將使用全域重鑄材料備用方案。</p><p>如果沒有安裝飾品模組，本模組還會添加綠寶石戒指和綠寶石護身符。它們可以使用綠寶石進行重鑄。</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/qAzaAyh.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"123\" height=\"71\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\"><strong>注意：&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#000\">適用於1.20.1的1.1版本完全重新編寫了所有代碼，因此如果你更新到此版本，現有世界中的重鑄工具將會損壞。不過，這個版本修復了之前版本中的所有問題。1.21.1版本受到NBT重構的影響，可能也適用此情況。</span></strong></span></p>",
